abstract: >-
  Pipeline for windowed Sentinel-2 reads, per-scene reflectance-offset audit, cloud masking,
  dry-season compositing, spectral indices and WorldCover proxy labels in Kampong Cham, Cambodia.
  Research pilot; no trained model and no accuracy claims.
